      "note": "Proprietary Statement of Cash Flows: the reconciliation's NET OPERATING ACTIVITIES prints 503,505 (Total; Electric 200,191, Sewer 252,813), including 'Due from other funds' 275,000, while the statement's net operating activities prints 228,505 (Electric 125,191, Sewer 52,813); the 275,000 equals the transfers out, which the cash flow shows as Transfers (net) 0. The statement figure 228,505 is recorded."
